@MiniMes.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5157

### Login (BackOffice user). Copy "token" from the response into @token below.
POST {{MiniMes.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "employeeCode": "admin", "password": "Demo@12345" }

### Login (kiosk operator: badge + station from kiosk appsettings)
POST {{MiniMes.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login-operator
Content-Type: application/json

{ "employeeCode": "EMP00123", "stationCode": "L1-TEST-01" }

###
@token = paste-token-here

### Claims as the API sees them
GET {{MiniMes.Api_HostAddress}}/api/debug/whoami
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 200 for Admin, 403 for Operator, 401 without token
GET {{MiniMes.Api_HostAddress}}/api/debug/admin-only
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 200 for Planner or Admin
GET {{MiniMes.Api_HostAddress}}/api/debug/planner-or-admin
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Factory configuration (any logged-in role can read)
GET {{MiniMes.Api_HostAddress}}/api/stations?lineId=1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Create station (Admin). Code: A-Z, 0-9, '-' only (used in MQTT topics); cannot be changed later.
POST {{MiniMes.Api_HostAddress}}/api/stations
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "lineId": 1, "code": "L1-AOI-02", "name": "AOI", "type": "Test" }

### Update station (Admin). No DELETE: set isActive=false instead.
PUT {{MiniMes.Api_HostAddress}}/api/stations/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "SMT", "type": "Smt", "isActive": true }
